title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf sync plan
catalog: CLI command
target: mf sync plan
summary: Compute a sync plan (into a freshly recreated plan repo)

!! Reference

```
Compute a sync plan (into a freshly recreated plan repo)

Usage: mf sync plan [OPTIONS] --intents <INTENTS> <REPO_A> <REPO_B>

Arguments:
  <REPO_A>
          

  <REPO_B>
          

Options:
      --intents <INTENTS>
          Path to the TOML intents file (scope + policies)

      --host <HOST>
          Repo (of the pair) to host the plan + sync database (default: canonical A)

      --on-conflict <ON_CONFLICT>
          Override every conflict rule: ask | skip | prefer:<repo>

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
